[size=5]Main features[/size]
[list]
[*]Every ranged-weapon ammo type weighs 0.
[*]Applies to both the encumbrance total and the inventory weight display.
[*]Only ammo is affected. Every other item keeps its weight.
[/list]

[size=5]Requirements[/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelaststandaftermath/mods/1]BepInEx for The Last Stand: Aftermath[/url]. Install it first.
[/list]

[size=5]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelaststandaftermath/mods/1]BepInEx[/url] [i](if no other mods were installed before, start the game once so BepInEx finishes setup, then quit)[/i].
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path examples:
[list]
[*]Steam: [code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\WeightlessAmmo.dll[/code]
[*]Epic: [code]C:\Program Files\Epic Games\The Last Stand Aftermath\BepInEx\plugins\WeightlessAmmo.dll[/code]
[/list]
[*]Start the game. Ammo now weighs 0 in your inventory.
[/list]

Not working? Open BepInEx\LogOutput.log and look for the Weightless Ammo loaded line.

[size=5]Uninstall[/size]
Delete WeightlessAmmo.dll from the BepInEx\plugins folder.

[size=5]Source and license[/size]
